  "releaseNotes": "Adds an explicit experimental PAL A1200 68EC020 factory with long Chip/ROM and byte CIA/Gayle timing rules, plus integer operand forms reached by native A1200 Kickstart 3.0 and DOS/graphics startup. The host owns motherboard arbitration. Default OCS profiles remain unchanged. Pipeline, cache and instruction timing are approximate; AGA chipset execution belongs to the CopperScreen consumer. See the README for scope and validation.",
